###  https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/evaluationonto-individuals#phonon_thermal_conductivity_contribution_task
:phonon_thermal_conductivity_contribution_task rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        eval:RegressionTask ;
                                               rdfs:comment "Evaluate normalized, unitless phonon mode contributions to thermal conductivity." ;
                                               rdfs:label "Phonon thermal conductivity contribution prediction" .


